OL,3,GNEWSAClimbing centre fined #67.5k over 
OL,4,Aman's cave death                       
OL,6,FA climbing centre has been fined       
OL,7,F#67,500 over the death of a man who    
OL,8,Fbecame trapped in an indoor cave       
OL,9,Fattraction.                            
OL,11,FCarl O'Keeffe, 49, from Lancaster,     
OL,12,Fsuffered fatal crush injuries when he  
OL,13,Fspent five hours stuck in a narrow     
OL,14,Ftunnel at Kong Adventure Centre in     
OL,15,FKeswick in April 2023, Newcastle Crown 
OL,16,FCourt heard.                           
OL,18,FHis family said they had been          
OL,19,Fdevastated by his death and had never  
OL,20,Fexpected a happy day out to end in     
OL,21,Ftragedy, while prosecutors said the    
OL,22,Fcave was an accident waiting to happen.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
