OL,3,GNEWSAClimbing centre fined #67.5k over 
OL,4,Aman's cave death                       
OL,6,FKing Kong Climbing Centre admitted     
OL,7,Fhealth and safety failures. Company    
OL,8,Fdirector Paul Cornforth, who designed  
OL,9,Findoor caving systems, was also charged
OL,10,Fbut no evidence was offered by         
OL,11,Fprosecutors.                           
